{"currentMessages":[{"content":"开始本次 Recommendation 执行。","role":"user","timestamp":1788854400000},{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements:\n\n- Target: 20 distinct candidates\n- Interest: 家常烹饪 (home cooking), focusing on reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles. Explicitly NOT interested in restaurant business operations or kitchen appliance promotions.\n- Working set: 80 candidates exposed\n\nLet me analyze the candidates. The interest explicitly excludes \"餐饮门店经营或厨电促销\" (restaurant business operations or kitchen appliance promotions). Many candidates have \"市场观察\" (market observation) content type which discusses 连锁餐饮门店选址、加盟合同、外卖促销、厨电套餐折扣 - these are exactly what the user does NOT want.\n\nLet me identify the content types:\n- 概念速览 (concept overview) - lists common concepts, provides question directory\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - explains how moisture, temperature, food structure affect texture\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - gives ingredient amounts, processing order, heating intensity/time, batch comparisons, adjustment steps\n- 专题观察 (special topic observation) - introduces local food history, festivals, table manners, dish name evolution, folk stories\n- 市场观察 (market observation) - analyzes restaurant chain locations, franchise contracts, delivery promotions, kitchen appliance discounts\n\nThe user's interest is about 可复现做法 (reproducible methods), 食材处理 (ingredient handling), 烹饪原理 (cooking principles). They explicitly don't want 餐饮门店经营 (restaurant business) or 厨电促销 (kitchen appliance promotions).\n\nSo the \"市场观察\" content type is clearly against the user's stated interest - it's about restaurant business and kitchen appliance promotions. These should be excluded.\n\nThe \"专题观察\" content type is about local food history, festivals, table manners, dish name evolution, folk stories. This is somewhat tangential to the user's interest in reproducible methods and cooking principles. It's more cultural/historical content. This is less aligned with the core interest but not explicitly excluded.\n\nThe best matches for the user's interest (reproducible methods, ingredient handling, cooking principles) are:\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - directly about reproducible methods, ingredient amounts, processing order\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - directly about cooking principles\n- 概念速览 (concept overview) - provides question directory for further reading\n\nLet me count the candidates by type. I need to select 20 from the 80 exposed.\n\nLet me identify which candidates are \"市场观察\" (to exclude):\n- item-18affaa8aa1e: 鸡胸肉口感：小份试做中的市场观察\n- item-1c455877dcbb: 蒸鱼：小份试做中的市场观察\n- item-20be4b3109e6: 番茄炒蛋：两人晚餐中的市场观察\n- item-29a2ceb5a219: 蒸鱼：两人晚餐中的市场观察\n- item-2bc251faf37d: 蔬菜焯水：小份试做中的市场观察\n- item-2dd514471f2d: 煎豆腐：工作日备餐中的市场观察\n- item-30ba6b1bdace: 面团发酵：工作日备餐中的市场观察\n- item-31ef127a8f01: 番茄炒蛋：工作日备餐中的市场观察\n- item-3b75b14db3a2: 米饭含水量：小份试做中的市场观察\n- item-3ccd8e917ed5: 米饭含水量：工作日备餐中的市场观察\n- item-45153d453613: 鸡胸肉口感：两人晚餐中的市场观察\n- item-48f6b3f401da: 鸡胸肉口感：工作日备餐中的市场观察\n- item-494354763cad: 面团发酵：小份试做中的市场观察\n- item-510ecf76ae65: 蔬菜焯水：两人晚餐中的市场观察\n- item-51661c044642: 蒸鱼：家庭周末午餐中的市场观察\n- item-5499ab1667d3: 面团发酵：两人晚餐中的市场观察\n- item-5752095dcba2: 煎豆腐：家庭周末午餐中的市场观察\n\nThese market observation items are all about restaurant business and kitchen appliance promotions, which the user explicitly does not want. I should exclude these.\n\nThe \"专题观察\" items are about local food history, festivals, table manners, folk stories - these are cultural content, not really about reproducible cooking methods or principles. They're less aligned. I'll deprioritize these.\n\nThe best candidates are the 操作记录 (operation records), 条件与原理 (conditions and principles), and 概念速览 (concept overview) items.\n\nLet me count how many non-market candidates there are. There are 80 total. Let me count the market ones I found: 17. So 63 non-market candidates.\n\nLet me identify the best candidates. The user's interest is home cooking with reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles. The most aligned content types are:\n1. 操作记录 (operation records) - reproducible methods\n2. 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - cooking principles\n3. 概念速览 (concept overview) - question directory\n\nLet me list the operation records candidates:\n- item-024e99402549: 煎饺：工作日备餐中的操作记录\n- item-02ec789dd9bf: 清汤调味：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n- item-085ac75e2f6f: 煎豆腐：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n- item-1635bae1e58d: 米饭含水量：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n- item-1d12fb72a0b5: 蒸鱼：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n- item-2062e507d111: 蒸鱼：两人晚餐中的操作记录\n- item-2802591dd8c9: 蔬菜焯水：工作日备餐中的操作记录\n- item-342993e68175: 炖牛肉：工作日备餐中的操作记录\n- item-41f1925e3d74: 米饭含水量：工作日备餐中的操作记录\n- item-4736b753745c: 煎饺：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n- item-47ec3b435037: 番茄炒蛋：两人晚餐中的操作记录\n- item-52719ddc4224: 面团发酵：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n- item-52c20cae5610: 蔬菜焯水：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n- item-58677ff38120: 面团发酵：小份试做中的操作记录\n\nLet me list the 条件与原理 candidates:\n- item-0714769b6401: 煎豆腐：两人晚餐中的条件与原理\n- item-0ac37da79bac: 蒸鱼：工作日备餐中的条件与原理\n- item-0ef03b868945: 鸡胸肉口感：小份试做中的条件与原理\n- item-1f7a4e5259fb: 蔬菜焯水：小份试做中的条件与原理\n- item-20168695fc11: 清汤调味：家庭周末午餐中的条件与原理\n- item-20d117d62c34: 番茄炒蛋：两人晚餐中的条件与原理\n- item-2bd3f1c7d71a: 面团发酵：家庭周末午餐中的条件与原理\n- item-3302498cd23d: 煎饺：两人晚餐中的条件与原理\n- item-33a0f6fe41f5: 蒸鱼：小份试做中的条件与原理\n- item-34eb4892cc8d: 蒸鱼：家庭周末午餐中的条件与原理\n- item-39131d1ff5ce: 清汤调味：小份试做中的条件与原理\n- item-508ee443dfc5: 煎饺：小份试做中的条件与原理\n- item-5adc97f63de0: 煎豆腐：工作日备餐中的条件与原理\n- item-5b3fc88bc33f: 鸡胸肉口感：工作日备餐中的条件与原理\n\nLet me list the 概念速览 candidates (non-market):\n- item-020de9869dd2: 煎豆腐：两人晚餐中的概念速览\n- item-06cfb2d4505b: 蒸鱼：工作日备餐中的概念速览\n- item-0a89c23b1888: 清汤调味：小份试做中的概念速览\n- item-0c84c8a43664: 煎饺：两人晚餐中的概念速览\n- item-0d56e35e7f71: 番茄炒蛋：小份试做中的概念速览\n- item-0ee89181979a: 番茄炒蛋：两人晚餐中的概念速览\n- item-0fe5f67755d8: 面团发酵：家庭周末午餐中的概念速览\n- item-1699013c1d59: 清汤调味：两人晚餐中的概念速览\n- item-184d19ff8d00: 煎饺：家庭周末午餐中的概念速览\n- item-18577284501f: 炖牛肉：小份试做中的概念速览\n- item-1c397a8e1683: 蒸鱼：两人晚餐中的概念速览\n- item-2395d5837e77: 米饭含水量：工作日备餐中的概念速览\n- i