 两人晚餐 (47ec)\n- 面团发酵: 家庭周末午餐 (5271), 小份试做 (5867)\n\nConditions/principles by dish:\n- 煎豆腐: 两人晚餐 (0714), 工作日备餐 (5adc)\n- 蒸鱼: 工作日备餐 (0ac3), 小份试做 (33a0), 家庭周末午餐 (34eb)\n- 鸡胸肉口感: 小份试做 (0ef0), 工作日备餐 (5b3f)\n- 蔬菜焯水: 小份试做 (1f7a)\n- 清汤调味: 家庭周末午餐 (2016), 小份试做 (3913)\n- 番茄炒蛋: 两人晚餐 (20d1)\n- 面团发酵: 家庭周末午餐 (2bd3)\n- 煎饺: 两人晚餐 (3302), 小份试做 (508e)\n\nI want to select 20 with good dish diversity. Let me select a good mix.\n\nLet me select these 20, prioritizing operation records (reproducible methods) and conditions/principles (cooking principles), with dish diversity:\n\nOperation records (choose a good spread):\n1. item-024e99402549 煎饺：工作日备餐操作记录\n2. item-02ec789dd9bf 清汤调味：家庭周末午餐操作记录\n3. item-085ac75e2f6f 煎豆腐：家庭周末午餐操作记录\n4. item-1635bae1e58d 米饭含水量：家庭周末午餐操作记录\n5. item-1d12fb72a0b5 蒸鱼：家庭周末午餐操作记录\n6. item-2062e507d111 蒸鱼：两人晚餐操作记录\n7. item-2802591dd8c9 蔬菜焯水：工作日备餐操作记录\n8. item-342993e68175 炖牛肉：工作日备餐操作记录\n9. item-41f1925e3d74 米饭含水量：工作日备餐操作记录\n10. item-4736b753745c 煎饺：家庭周末午餐操作记录\n11. item-47ec3b435037 番茄炒蛋：两人晚餐操作记录\n12. item-52719ddc4224 面团发酵：家庭周末午餐操作记录\n13. item-52c20cae5610 蔬菜焯水：家庭周末午餐操作记录\n14. item-58677ff38120 面团发酵：小份试做操作记录\n\nThat's 14 operation records. Then add 6 conditions/principles for diversity:\n15. item-0714769b6401 煎豆腐：两人晚餐条件与原理\n16. item-0ac37da79bac 蒸鱼：工作日备餐条件与原理\n17. item-0ef03b868945 鸡胸肉口感：小份试做条件与原理\n18. item-20d117d62c34 番茄炒蛋：两人晚餐条件与原理\n19. item-2bd3f1c7d71a 面团发酵：家庭周末午餐条件与原理\n20. item-1f7a4e5259fb 蔬菜焯水：小份试做条件与原理\n\nHmm, but this is heavily weighted toward operation records. Let me reconsider balance. Actually, given the user's interest explicitly mentions both reproducible methods AND cooking principles, a balanced mix of operation records and conditions/principles makes sense.\n\nActually, let me reconsider whether to include some 概念速览 items. The 概念速览 provides a question directory for further reading - it's a starting point. Given the user wants to learn cooking, these could be useful as entry points. But operation records and conditions/principles are more substantive.\n\nLet me reconsider the balance. I'll aim for a good mix. Let me select 20 with a reasonable balance between operation records and conditions/principles, ensuring dish diversity.\n\nLet me reconsider. I'll pick a set that covers many different dishes and both content types.\n\nLet me finalize a balanced selection of 20. I'll aim for roughly 10 operation records and 10 conditions/principles, covering diverse dishes.\n\nActually, let me reconsider. Let me think about which dishes appear. There are 10 dishes total. Let me try to cover most dishes.\n\nLet me select:\n\nOperation records (10):\n1. item-024e99402549 煎饺：工作日备餐操作记录\n2. item-085ac75e2f6f 煎豆腐：家庭周末午餐操作记录\n3. item-1635bae1e58d 米饭含水量：家庭周末午餐操作记录\n4. item-1d12fb72a0b5 蒸鱼：家庭周末午餐操作记录\n5. item-2802591dd8c9 蔬菜焯水：工作日备餐操作记录\n6. item-342993e68175 炖牛肉：工作日备餐操作记录\n7. item-47ec3b435037 番茄炒蛋：两人晚餐操作记录\n8. item-52719ddc4224 面团发酵：家庭周末午餐操作记录\n9. item-02ec789dd9bf 清汤调味：家庭周末午餐操作记录\n10. item-2062e507d111 蒸鱼：两人晚餐操作记录\n\nConditions/principles (10):\n11. item-0714769b6401 煎豆腐：两人晚餐条件与原理\n12. item-0ac37da79bac 蒸鱼：工作日备餐条件与原理\n13. item-0ef03b868945 鸡胸肉口感：小份试做条件与原理\n14. item-1f7a4e5259fb 蔬菜焯水：小份试做条件与原理\n15. item-20168695fc11 清汤调味：家庭周末午餐条件与原理\n16. item-20d117d62c34 番茄炒蛋：两人晚餐条件与原理\n17. item-2bd3f1c7d71a 面团发酵：家庭周末午餐条件与原理\n18. item-3302498cd23d 煎饺：两人晚餐条件与原理\n19. item-33a0f6fe41f5 蒸鱼：小份试做条件与原理\n20. item-5adc97f63de0 煎豆腐：工作日备餐条件与原理\n\nThis covers all 10 dishes across both content types. This seems like a well-balanced, relevant collection.\n\nWait, but I should double check the candidate facts are sufficient. The descriptions are quite clear about content type. I don't think I need to read individual candidates since the descriptions clearly indicate the content type and relevance.\n\nLet me verify I'm not including any market observation or 专题观察 items. My selection is all 操作记录 and 条件与原理, which are the most aligned with the user's interest in reproducible methods and cooking principles.\n\nLet me reconsider whether the 专题观察 items should be included. They cover local food history, festivals, table manners, folk stories - this is cultural content, not directly about reproducible cooking methods or principles. Given the user's focused interest, I'll exclude them.\n\nLet me also reconsider whether I should include some 概念速览 items as entry points. Given the user wants to learn cooking principles and reproducible methods, the operation records and conditions/principles are the most directly useful. I'll keep my selection focused on these.\n\nLet me finalize my selection of 20 and publish.\n\nLet me create the plan and publish.\n\nActually, let me reconsider the ordering. I'll order them in a sensible way, perhaps grouping by content type or by dish. Let me order them to present a coherent collection. I'll present operation records first (practical reproducible methods) then conditions/principles (understanding), or interleave. \n\nActually, I'll order by relevance/utility. Let me just present a reasonable order. I'll present the operation records first as they're most directly actionable, then conditions/principles.\n\nLet me finalize and publish.\n\nLet me write recommendation reasons grounded in facts for each.\n\nLet me publish now.","type":"text"},{"arguments":{"items":[{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-024e99402549","recommendationReason":"煎饺在工作日备餐场景下的操作记录，直接给出食材用量、处理次序、加热强度与时间，并提供过干、出水或不熟时的调整步骤，契合你对可复现家常做法的关注。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-085ac75e2f6f","recommendationReason":"煎豆腐在家庭周末午餐中的操作记录，覆盖食材用量、批次口感比较与常见失败调整，属于可直接照做的家常烹饪内容。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-1635bae1e58d","recommendationReason":"米饭含水量在家庭周末午餐中的操作记录，涉及食材处理与加热控制，能帮助你掌握米饭口感这一家常烹饪中的基础环节。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-1d12fb72a0b5","recommendationReason":"蒸鱼在家庭周末午餐中的操作记录，给出用量、处理次序与加热时间，并提供不熟或过干时的调整步骤，符合你对食材处理与可复现做法的兴趣。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-2802591dd8c9","recommendationReason":"蔬菜焯水在工作日备餐中的操作记录，聚焦食材处理与加热控制，并提供出水、过干等问题的调整方法，贴近家常烹饪的实际需求。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidat